1
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:12,020
=Fatal Proximity to Him=

2
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:14,060
=Episode 3=

3
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:19,580
He Lan had a lot to do with me
getting out of the hospital.

4
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,260
No wonder whenever I'm near him,

5
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:23,620
I feel this warmth flowing through me.

6
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:25,980
The closer I get,

7
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:27,700
the stronger it feels.

8
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:31,740
So the closer I am to him,

9
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:33,900
the better it is for my body.

10
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:36,660
(I need to ask that old system guy)

11
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:38,060
(what the hell is going on.)

12
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:41,380
I'm going to die on April 4, 2025.

13
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:45,020
Care to explain?

14
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:46,900
I was avoiding him
so I could stay alive.

15
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:47,860
And now,

16
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:49,380
I can't stay alive without him?

17
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:50,820
So either way, I'm doomed to die?

18
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:52,580
(A system bug has occurred.)

19
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:54,140
(There's nothing I can do.)

20
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,380
Are you messing with me?

21
00:00:56,620 --> 00:00:57,060
Are you...

22
00:01:00,180 --> 00:01:00,900
This is so frustrating!

23
00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:08,420
(He Lan
Add to Contacts)

24
00:01:16,580 --> 00:01:18,660
(New Friend: Luo Xiyu)

25
00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:33,500
Can we switch seats back?

26
00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:35,580
Pretty please?

27
00:01:35,860 --> 00:01:36,540
Fine.

28
00:01:36,540 --> 00:01:37,420
You're back!

29
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:37,980
Yeah.

30
00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:39,620
Give me a hand.

31
00:01:49,540 --> 00:01:49,900
Hey...

32
00:01:50,940 --> 00:01:51,420
Well,

33
00:01:51,420 --> 00:01:52,380
I'm sitting here again.

34
00:01:52,460 --> 00:01:54,300
Maybe accept my WeChat request
when you get a chance?

35
00:01:55,620 --> 00:01:57,220
So I'm not distracting you anymore?

36
00:01:58,100 --> 00:01:59,820
A little pressure keeps me motivated.

37
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:01,980
And since you're so good at everything,

38
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:03,180
being around you

39
00:02:03,300 --> 00:02:05,140
makes me push myself even harder.

40
00:02:05,540 --> 00:02:06,460
Besides, my mom always says

41
00:02:06,580 --> 00:02:07,980
when you meet someone better than you,

42
00:02:08,180 --> 00:02:09,540
you should learn from them,

43
00:02:09,540 --> 00:02:10,380
rise to the challenge,

44
00:02:10,740 --> 00:02:11,420
and never give up.

45
00:02:13,980 --> 00:02:14,660
Listen,

46
00:02:15,340 --> 00:02:17,100
stay away from Xiyu from now on.

47
00:02:17,860 --> 00:02:19,100
She's already dropped to second place.

48
00:02:19,100 --> 00:02:19,780
Ma'am,

49
00:02:20,100 --> 00:02:21,020
this is He Lan.

50
00:02:21,140 --> 00:02:22,580
He's number one in our class now.

51
00:02:22,740 --> 00:02:24,340
He got full marks in everything
except the essay.

52
00:02:24,660 --> 00:02:25,100
Really?

53
00:02:26,220 --> 00:02:26,940
Well, He Lan,

54
00:02:27,060 --> 00:02:27,620
then you

55
00:02:27,620 --> 00:02:29,140
have to help Xiyu with her studies.

56
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:31,420
I just love kids who get good grades.

57
00:02:32,060 --> 00:02:33,140
You really are just like your mom.

58
00:02:33,420 --> 00:02:34,380
Of course.

59
00:02:34,540 --> 00:02:36,420
Like mother, like daughter.

60
00:02:47,820 --> 00:02:48,940
What are you doing?

61
00:02:49,540 --> 00:02:50,780
Uh...

62
00:02:51,620 --> 00:02:52,780
I just want to

63
00:02:52,900 --> 00:02:53,660
sit a little closer to you

64
00:02:53,900 --> 00:02:55,300
and soak up some of your good luck,

65
00:02:55,540 --> 00:02:57,620
(Current Charge: 4%; 5%; 6%; 7%)
so I can get a perfect score next time.

66
00:02:57,860 --> 00:02:59,540
(Current Charge: 31%)
(I charged up so fast today.)

67
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:00,980
(Current Charge: 32%; 33%)
(Another beautiful day.)

68
00:03:03,100 --> 00:03:05,340
Let's be friends from now on.

69
00:03:08,580 --> 00:03:10,100
Come on!

70
00:03:12,940 --> 00:03:14,980
(Current Charge: 98%; 99%;
Fully Charged)

71
00:03:16,500 --> 00:03:17,100
All set.

72
00:03:27,300 --> 00:03:30,220
(One Month Later)

73
00:03:30,300 --> 00:03:32,620
(Cafeteria)

74
00:03:32,620 --> 00:03:34,300
Xiyu, where have you been?

75
00:03:34,300 --> 00:03:35,580
I've been looking everywhere for you.

76
00:03:38,740 --> 00:03:39,700
What's wrong?

77
00:03:39,780 --> 00:03:40,740
Why the long face?

78
00:03:41,260 --> 00:03:42,580
Your leg's healed,

79
00:03:42,580 --> 00:03:44,380
and everything's back on track
for the Dance Academy.

80
00:03:44,380 --> 00:03:45,620
So why aren't you happy?

81
00:03:46,380 --> 00:03:47,980
Just wait till you get into
the Dance Academy

82
00:03:48,100 --> 00:03:50,020
and show Song Shuqi who the better
dancer really is.

83
00:03:50,140 --> 00:03:50,740
She'll be furious.

84
00:03:51,620 --> 00:03:52,900
She's not the problem right now.

85
00:03:53,580 --> 00:03:56,020
The problem is my exam's
only two months away.

86
00:03:56,260 --> 00:03:57,660
Isn't there a prep course?

87
00:03:57,980 --> 00:03:59,700
You could cram for the next two months.

88
00:04:00,020 --> 00:04:01,380
You know what my mom's like.

89
00:04:01,660 --> 00:04:03,260
All she wants is for me
to get into Tsinghua or Peking.

90
00:04:03,500 --> 00:04:05,220
She's already canceled
all my dance classes.

91
00:04:05,580 --> 00:04:07,020
So if I want

92
00:04:07,020 --> 00:04:08,140
to take the prep course,

93
00:04:09,020 --> 00:04:10,020
I'll have to pay for it myself.

94
00:04:10,260 --> 00:04:10,780
Twenty thousand yuan.

95
00:04:11,140 --> 00:04:12,140
Twenty thousand?

96
00:04:13,020 --> 00:04:14,060
That's a lot!

97
00:04:14,740 --> 00:04:16,500
The arts really burn through money.

98
00:04:18,020 --> 00:04:19,180
You could sell me.

99
00:04:19,180 --> 00:04:19,860
By the kilogram.

100
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:20,580
Go on.

101
00:04:20,780 --> 00:04:21,540
How much do you think I'm worth?

102
00:04:23,540 --> 00:04:25,140
Probably...

103
00:04:26,420 --> 00:04:29,020
enough to pay for half a class.

104
00:04:29,820 --> 00:04:30,380
Ugh!

105
00:04:31,580 --> 00:04:33,140
This is so frustrating.

106
00:04:36,300 --> 00:04:37,060
Zhang Jinghang!

107
00:04:37,700 --> 00:04:38,340
Up top!

108
00:04:38,620 --> 00:04:39,460
Here!

109
00:04:40,220 --> 00:04:40,900
Zhang Jinghang!

110
00:04:41,540 --> 00:04:43,100
Xiyu needs twenty grand
for dance lessons.

111
00:04:43,140 --> 00:04:44,020
Your family's loaded.

112
00:04:44,260 --> 00:04:44,780
You pay!

113
00:04:46,020 --> 00:04:46,700
Don't listen to her.

114
00:04:46,700 --> 00:04:47,740
I'll figure it out myself.

115
00:04:48,940 --> 00:04:49,900
It costs that much?

116
00:04:51,420 --> 00:04:51,980
Sir,

117
00:04:52,380 --> 00:04:53,940
I'm still a high school senior,

118
00:04:54,340 --> 00:04:56,740
and I only have two hours free
on weekend afternoons.

119
00:04:57,700 --> 00:04:58,500
Could you...

120
00:04:58,660 --> 00:05:00,540
advance me a year's pay?

121
00:05:05,220 --> 00:05:05,940
Get out.

122
00:05:06,900 --> 00:05:07,300
Okay.

123
00:05:09,020 --> 00:05:11,620
(Guangxi Rural Credit Union
Please Enter Your PIN)

124
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:13,300
(Account Balance: 0.32 Yuan
Available Balance: 0.32 Yuan)

125
00:05:13,740 --> 00:05:14,820
(Mom clearly said)

126
00:05:14,820 --> 00:05:16,900
(all the money from my red envelopes
has been saved on this card every year.)

127
00:05:17,180 --> 00:05:18,660
(She said it was for
when I got married.)

128
00:05:19,100 --> 00:05:19,860
(Liar.)

129
00:05:21,140 --> 00:05:22,220
This is just silver wrapped in gold.

130
00:05:23,220 --> 00:05:24,780
(My dad was such a jerk.)

131
00:05:25,380 --> 00:05:26,860
(He cheated on my mom when I was three,)

132
00:05:26,860 --> 00:05:28,980
(and even the "gold" pendant he bought
me was just gold-plated silver.)

133
00:05:31,780 --> 00:05:33,300
I saw you holding your stomach.

134
00:05:33,300 --> 00:05:34,420
Are you on your period?

135
00:05:34,980 --> 00:05:35,660
Have some water.

136
00:05:35,820 --> 00:05:36,340
Okay.

137
00:05:47,380 --> 00:05:49,100
Zhang Jinghang really
got you twenty grand?

138
00:05:49,300 --> 00:05:51,580
Some people rack their brains
trying to find twenty grand,

139
00:05:51,940 --> 00:05:54,060
while others can just hand it over
like nothing.

140
00:05:54,340 --> 00:05:56,100
That shows how much you mean to him.

141
00:05:56,100 --> 00:05:57,140
Put it away before you lose it.

142
00:06:00,660 --> 00:06:01,580
Zhang Jinghang,

143
00:06:01,860 --> 00:06:02,780
you're the man!

144
00:06:03,020 --> 00:06:04,780
You're totally Xiyu's Prince Charming.

145
00:06:05,020 --> 00:06:05,780
What's that called again?

146
00:06:06,020 --> 00:06:06,820
The power of money.

147
00:06:07,900 --> 00:06:08,700
Thank you.

148
00:06:09,100 --> 00:06:10,300
I'll definitely pay you back.

149
00:06:10,620 --> 00:06:11,220
No, you don't have to.

150
00:06:11,420 --> 00:06:12,700
I'm just glad I could help.

151
00:06:14,340 --> 00:06:15,140
Zhang Jinghang,

152
00:06:15,460 --> 00:06:16,500
you're so generous.

153
00:06:39,860 --> 00:06:40,420
Mom,

154
00:06:41,100 --> 00:06:42,740
you don't have to go to
the hospital today?

155
00:06:42,860 --> 00:06:43,540
Nope.

156
00:06:43,700 --> 00:06:45,780
I finally have a whole weekend off.

157
00:06:46,220 --> 00:06:48,060
I'll make you a nice dinner.

158
00:06:48,460 --> 00:06:49,700
What would you like for dinner?

159
00:06:49,950 --> 00:06:50,890
Ugh...

160
00:06:51,580 --> 00:06:52,260
What's wrong?

161
00:06:52,460 --> 00:06:54,420
I've been feeling really sleepy lately.

162
00:06:54,420 --> 00:06:55,660
And kind of dizzy.

163
00:06:55,660 --> 00:06:56,980
You should get checked again.

164
00:06:57,140 --> 00:06:57,900
It's fine, Mom.

165
00:06:58,060 --> 00:06:59,740
I've already had blood tests,

166
00:06:59,940 --> 00:07:00,980
CT scans,

167
00:07:01,020 --> 00:07:02,180
even an ECG.

168
00:07:02,540 --> 00:07:03,820
They didn't find anything wrong.

169
00:07:04,180 --> 00:07:05,420
If I get any more tests,

170
00:07:05,580 --> 00:07:07,660
they'll have to start digging
through my DNA.

171
00:07:07,820 --> 00:07:08,580
Oh, you.

172
00:07:08,820 --> 00:07:09,820
Don't be ridiculous.

173
00:07:10,020 --> 00:07:12,660
I think I've just been

174
00:07:12,860 --> 00:07:14,100
studying too hard lately.

175
00:07:14,420 --> 00:07:15,460
I can't sleep at night,

176
00:07:15,820 --> 00:07:16,580
so I'm sleep-deprived.

177
00:07:16,580 --> 00:07:17,420
I just need some rest.

178
00:07:17,540 --> 00:07:18,820
Don't blame me, okay?

179
00:07:18,940 --> 00:07:20,220
Senior year is really important.

180
00:07:20,820 --> 00:07:22,020
Once you get into Tsinghua or Peking,

181
00:07:22,100 --> 00:07:23,660
you can do whatever you want.

182
00:07:23,860 --> 00:07:25,060
I know, Mom.

183
00:07:25,300 --> 00:07:26,140
Don't worry.

184
00:07:26,340 --> 00:07:27,420
No matter how tired I get,

185
00:07:27,580 --> 00:07:28,900
even if I have to write
till my hand falls off,

186
00:07:28,900 --> 00:07:30,540
I'll get into Tsinghua or Peking.

187
00:07:30,540 --> 00:07:31,980
I won't let you down.

188
00:07:32,740 --> 00:07:33,620
That's my girl.

189
00:07:33,700 --> 00:07:34,700
I believe in you.

190
00:07:35,740 --> 00:07:37,220
I'm gonna take a nap, then.

191
00:07:37,660 --> 00:07:38,300
Go get some sleep.

192
00:07:38,420 --> 00:07:40,180
Your health comes first.

193
00:07:40,180 --> 00:07:40,940
Go on. Get some rest.

194
00:07:40,940 --> 00:07:41,780
Oh, right!

195
00:07:42,140 --> 00:07:43,700
I want braised pork buns tonight,

196
00:07:44,060 --> 00:07:45,500
and eggplant in garlic sauce,

197
00:07:45,620 --> 00:07:46,900
and lettuce with oyster sauce.

198
00:07:47,340 --> 00:07:49,540
Don't wake me up
until they're all ready.

199
00:07:49,860 --> 00:07:50,260
I...

200
00:07:50,940 --> 00:07:52,100
I've been a light sleeper lately.

201
00:07:52,380 --> 00:07:53,300
Okay.

202
00:07:53,580 --> 00:07:54,540
Got it.

203
00:07:54,860 --> 00:07:55,540
Go get some sleep.

204
00:07:56,060 --> 00:07:56,700
I'm going.

205
00:08:20,300 --> 00:08:23,300
I'm giving you a chance to repay a debt.

206
00:08:25,060 --> 00:08:26,380
Just tell me if you're in.

207
00:08:28,180 --> 00:08:29,460
Why don't you ask Zhang Jinghang?

208
00:08:30,500 --> 00:08:32,220
He's taller than you,

209
00:08:32,220 --> 00:08:33,540
but he's not as capable.

210
00:08:33,780 --> 00:08:35,100
He won't be much help when it counts.

211
00:08:37,540 --> 00:08:38,780
A little more to the right.

212
00:08:39,380 --> 00:08:41,060
Your right. This is my left.

213
00:08:41,820 --> 00:08:42,260
Yeah, that's it.

214
00:08:42,780 --> 00:08:43,740
Right there.

215
00:08:46,940 --> 00:08:47,700
I've got it pinned down.

216
00:08:47,940 --> 00:08:48,940
Hold steady.

217
00:08:51,140 --> 00:08:52,780
Did you plan on doing this
from the start?

218
00:08:55,060 --> 00:08:55,860
Make sure you're steady.

219
00:08:55,860 --> 00:08:56,660
I'm jumping.

220
00:08:57,700 --> 00:08:58,180
Three.

221
00:08:58,580 --> 00:08:59,100
Two.

222
00:08:59,420 --> 00:08:59,940
One.

223
00:09:02,580 --> 00:09:04,180
(My charge is safe today.)

224
00:09:04,300 --> 00:09:06,260
(I can avoid my mom and recharge.)

225
00:09:06,580 --> 00:09:08,060
(Two birds with one stone.)

226
00:09:09,260 --> 00:09:11,340
Don't dancers usually
have strict weight requirements?

227
00:09:17,660 --> 00:09:19,820
Now I know why you came to me
instead of Zhang Jinghang.

228
00:09:20,380 --> 00:09:20,820
Exactly.

229
00:09:21,020 --> 00:09:22,180
He's not really suited
for doing bad things.

230
00:09:23,340 --> 00:09:23,900
Oh, right.

231
00:09:24,540 --> 00:09:25,460
A good deed should go all the way.

232
00:09:25,540 --> 00:09:26,380
See it through to the end.

233
00:09:26,980 --> 00:09:28,700
After I finish dance class,

234
00:09:28,980 --> 00:09:30,180
you'll still have to help me climb up

235
00:09:30,700 --> 00:09:31,180
and get home.

236
00:09:32,860 --> 00:09:33,860
Alright now, let's go.

237
00:09:39,380 --> 00:09:40,380
One-and-a.

238
00:09:40,380 --> 00:09:41,500
Two-and-a.

239
00:09:41,500 --> 00:09:42,580
Three-and-a.

240
00:09:42,580 --> 00:09:43,780
Four-and-a.

241
00:09:43,860 --> 00:09:44,980
Five-and-a.

242
00:09:44,980 --> 00:09:45,380
Six.

243
00:09:45,780 --> 00:09:46,540
Very good.

244
00:09:46,540 --> 00:09:47,140
Perfect.

245
00:09:47,380 --> 00:09:48,380
Seven-and-a.

246
00:09:48,660 --> 00:09:49,300
Hold it.

247
00:09:49,620 --> 00:09:49,980
It's fine.

248
00:09:49,980 --> 00:09:50,620
Let's do it again.

249
00:09:50,980 --> 00:09:51,620
Lift up.

250
00:09:51,940 --> 00:09:52,660
Luo Xiyu!

251
00:09:53,660 --> 00:09:54,220
Mom?

252
00:09:56,660 --> 00:09:57,620
What are you doing here?

253
00:09:58,180 --> 00:09:58,860
Ms. Lin,

254
00:09:59,220 --> 00:10:00,260
I contacted you before.

255
00:10:00,420 --> 00:10:01,380
I said her dance lessons were stopped.

256
00:10:01,380 --> 00:10:02,660
Why is Luo Xiyu still here?

257
00:10:02,780 --> 00:10:03,260
Mom,

258
00:10:03,300 --> 00:10:04,900
I was the one who came here to learn.

259
00:10:04,900 --> 00:10:05,660
Don't say another word.

260
00:10:05,820 --> 00:10:06,220
Wait,

261
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:07,180
Ms. Luo,

262
00:10:07,260 --> 00:10:08,540
is there some misunderstanding?

263
00:10:08,740 --> 00:10:09,420
Ms. Lin,

264
00:10:09,460 --> 00:10:11,700
Xiyu has studied ballet with you
for many years.

265
00:10:11,900 --> 00:10:13,180
You know better than anyone

266
00:10:13,340 --> 00:10:14,260
how difficult this path is.

267
00:10:14,740 --> 00:10:15,780
Even if she dances well,

268
00:10:16,060 --> 00:10:17,260
it's still a career of youth.

269
00:10:17,860 --> 00:10:18,340
Otherwise,

270
00:10:18,380 --> 00:10:19,740
you wouldn't have left
the Ballet Company.

271
00:10:19,740 --> 00:10:20,180
Right?

272
00:10:20,180 --> 00:10:20,660
Mom,

273
00:10:20,980 --> 00:10:22,300
I lied to Ms. Lin.

274
00:10:22,300 --> 00:10:24,140
I told her you approved of me
coming here.

275
00:10:24,140 --> 00:10:25,100
Don't say anything.

276
00:10:25,540 --> 00:10:26,180
Ms. Lin,

277
00:10:26,700 --> 00:10:27,380
you know that

278
00:10:27,780 --> 00:10:29,860
Xiyu has always had excellent grades.

279
00:10:30,100 --> 00:10:31,260
At this critical moment,

280
00:10:31,660 --> 00:10:33,460
let's not let this distract her, okay?

281
00:10:33,460 --> 00:10:34,340
Ms. Luo,

282
00:10:34,340 --> 00:10:35,220
she's an excellent child.

283
00:10:35,220 --> 00:10:36,260
She has real talent.

284
00:10:36,260 --> 00:10:37,620
She loves dance.

285
00:10:37,620 --> 00:10:38,420
Ms. Lin,

286
00:10:39,260 --> 00:10:40,780
not everything is worth chasing
for money.

287
00:10:41,380 --> 00:10:41,900
Mom.

288
00:10:42,300 --> 00:10:43,380
I'm sorry, Ms. Lin.

289
00:10:43,380 --> 00:10:43,620
Move.

290
00:10:43,620 --> 00:10:43,980
Mom.

291
00:10:43,980 --> 00:10:44,420
Let's go.

292
00:10:45,100 --> 00:10:45,820
We're going home.

293
00:10:47,060 --> 00:10:47,540
Mom.

294
00:10:50,380 --> 00:10:52,540
(We'll see how you dance now.)

295
00:10:54,500 --> 00:10:56,980
Now I finally know why Zhang Jinghang
doesn't like you.

296
00:10:58,620 --> 00:10:59,100
You...

297
00:11:01,210 --> 00:11:01,730
Hey...

298
00:11:10,380 --> 00:11:12,460
Ms. Lin has taught me for years

299
00:11:12,700 --> 00:11:13,820
and has always been so kind to me.

300
00:11:14,260 --> 00:11:15,900
Now it's all ruined.

301
00:11:16,540 --> 00:11:17,980
Why don't you just find another teacher?

302
00:11:18,460 --> 00:11:20,660
Good teachers are hard to find.

303
00:11:20,740 --> 00:11:22,420
You can't just find one
whenever you want.

304
00:11:23,020 --> 00:11:25,380
By the time I find a good teacher,

305
00:11:25,700 --> 00:11:27,540
the exam will probably already be over.

306
00:11:30,740 --> 00:11:32,500
Maybe Ms. Lin is waiting for your call.

307
00:11:32,740 --> 00:11:33,140
Right.

308
00:11:33,420 --> 00:11:34,580
Why don't you try again?

309
00:11:36,540 --> 00:11:38,300
If you want to give up now,

310
00:11:39,340 --> 00:11:40,460
I wouldn't be surprised.

311
00:11:40,900 --> 00:11:42,260
Who said I was giving up?

312
00:11:42,820 --> 00:11:44,300
I'm calling Ms. Lin right now.

313
00:11:45,260 --> 00:11:46,260
(Calling Ms. Lin...)

314
00:11:49,300 --> 00:11:50,420
Hello, Ms. Lin.

315
00:11:50,980 --> 00:11:51,980
This is Xiyu.

316
00:11:52,900 --> 00:11:53,660
I'm sorry

317
00:11:53,980 --> 00:11:56,020
for what my mom said to you that day.

318
00:11:57,180 --> 00:11:57,580
Okay.

319
00:11:57,700 --> 00:11:58,660
Thank you, Ms. Lin.

320
00:12:00,740 --> 00:12:02,300
Ms. Lin said she isn't mad at me.

321
00:12:02,460 --> 00:12:03,820
She even agreed to keep teaching me.

322
00:12:04,020 --> 00:12:04,460
Oh, right.

323
00:12:04,540 --> 00:12:05,020
She also said

324
00:12:05,020 --> 00:12:07,220
the Dance Academy is holding
a last-minute lecture tonight.

325
00:12:07,580 --> 00:12:08,540
She said I absolutely have to go.

326
00:12:09,460 --> 00:12:11,220
But it's Thursday.
We have evening study hall.

327
00:12:11,220 --> 00:12:11,900
How are you going to get there?

328
00:12:18,620 --> 00:12:20,340
That's all for today's class.

329
00:12:20,380 --> 00:12:20,980
Class dismissed.

330
00:12:24,220 --> 00:12:25,100
Ms. Shen,

331
00:12:25,460 --> 00:12:25,660
Luo...

332
00:12:25,660 --> 00:12:26,860
Luo Xiyu has a stomachache.

333
00:12:27,060 --> 00:12:28,020
That's not the stomach.

334
00:12:28,140 --> 00:12:28,860
That's the liver.

335
00:12:28,860 --> 00:12:29,860
Could it be hepatitis?

336
00:12:30,900 --> 00:12:31,380
Here.

337
00:12:31,740 --> 00:12:32,860
This is the gallbladder.

338
00:12:33,060 --> 00:12:35,060
If this hurts, she might need surgery.

339
00:12:35,380 --> 00:12:37,340
She went to the hospital last time
and they found nothing.

340
00:12:37,740 --> 00:12:39,100
Turns out they just missed the cause.

341
00:12:39,260 --> 00:12:40,780
I need to call her mom.

342
00:12:41,180 --> 00:12:41,700
Ms. Shen,

343
00:12:42,060 --> 00:12:42,660
that's not necessary.

344
00:12:42,980 --> 00:12:43,900
It doesn't hurt anymore.

345
00:12:44,340 --> 00:12:44,820
Really.

346
00:12:44,900 --> 00:12:45,700
It doesn't hurt at all.

347
00:12:45,860 --> 00:12:46,660
(Outstanding Class; Honor Banner)
Xiyu,

348
00:12:46,660 --> 00:12:48,020
(Outstanding Class; Honor Banner)
I know you love studying,

349
00:12:48,020 --> 00:12:49,540
but your health matters most.

350
00:12:49,580 --> 00:12:51,700
If anything feels wrong,
you have to tell me.

351
00:12:52,140 --> 00:12:52,780
Ms. Shen,

352
00:12:53,180 --> 00:12:54,580
I'm really fine now.

353
00:12:54,740 --> 00:12:55,380
Completely fine.

354
00:12:55,420 --> 00:12:56,180
Perfectly healthy.

355
00:12:56,420 --> 00:12:57,060
Good.

356
00:12:57,220 --> 00:12:57,620
Okay.

357
00:13:00,300 --> 00:13:01,260
What should we do?

358
00:13:07,420 --> 00:13:08,500
Everyone,

359
00:13:08,780 --> 00:13:09,780
there's a notice on the bulletin board.

360
00:13:09,780 --> 00:13:10,740
The power will be repaired tonight,

361
00:13:10,740 --> 00:13:11,380
so evening study hall

362
00:13:11,380 --> 00:13:12,180
is canceled!

363
00:13:12,180 --> 00:13:13,620
(Quiet Upon Entry; Study Once Seated;
Focus on Your Studies)

364
00:13:13,980 --> 00:13:14,860
Hurry and pack up your things.

365
00:13:15,060 --> 00:13:15,540
Quick.

366
00:13:22,100 --> 00:13:23,540
Ms. Lin even demonstrated
the moves for me today.

367
00:13:23,660 --> 00:13:24,980
(Guan Ying Billiards & Games Club)
She pointed out all my problems.

368
00:13:25,100 --> 00:13:26,260
(Thank goodness.)

369
00:13:26,380 --> 00:13:27,700
(Luckily Song Shuqi didn't go.)

370
00:13:28,180 --> 00:13:29,180
(Otherwise, you'd have been exposed.)

371
00:13:29,940 --> 00:13:30,500
He Lan,

372
00:13:30,740 --> 00:13:31,580
hang in there a little longer.

373
00:13:31,580 --> 00:13:32,780
(Guan Ying Billiards & Games Club)
I'll go get backup right now!

374
00:13:38,180 --> 00:13:39,300
Weren't you so tough?

375
00:13:39,460 --> 00:13:40,820
You dared send me to the station!

376
00:13:40,860 --> 00:13:41,860
Did you really think

377
00:13:41,980 --> 00:13:43,500
I'd never get out?

378
00:13:46,980 --> 00:13:47,820
Get him!

379
00:14:13,420 --> 00:14:14,220
Xiyu!

380
00:14:15,500 --> 00:14:16,660
I... I didn't mean to.

381
00:14:16,660 --> 00:14:17,580
I was just...

382
00:14:17,580 --> 00:14:18,220
passing by.

383
00:14:21,700 --> 00:14:22,780
Come at me and leave her alone!

384
00:14:39,980 --> 00:14:41,060
My leg won't let me run.

385
00:14:49,780 --> 00:14:50,340
Go!

386
00:14:50,580 --> 00:14:51,060
Leave me.

387
00:14:51,060 --> 00:14:52,100
What happens to you if I leave?

388
00:14:52,420 --> 00:14:53,220
I'll be fine.

389
00:14:53,420 --> 00:14:53,980
Go!

390
00:14:57,340 --> 00:14:58,700
I died in 2025 before.

391
00:14:59,700 --> 00:15:00,860
So nothing should happen now, right?

392
00:15:02,580 --> 00:15:04,340
Let's see how you run now.

393
00:15:26,460 --> 00:15:27,620
Xiyu!

394
00:15:40,300 --> 00:15:41,460
Xiyu!

395
00:15:44,380 --> 00:15:45,100
(Oh no.)

396
00:15:45,300 --> 00:15:46,740
(Am I going to die again?)

397
00:16:02,780 --> 00:16:03,900
(Next stop:)

398
00:16:04,300 --> 00:16:05,540
(Do not talk to the driver)
(Dongting Lake Station.)

399
00:16:06,220 --> 00:16:07,140
(Passengers who need to get off...)

400
00:16:07,140 --> 00:16:08,180
(I'm back on the bus again.)

401
00:16:10,220 --> 00:16:11,580
(So I really am trapped in a loop.)

402
00:16:14,180 --> 00:16:16,340
(Those dreams really happened.)

403
00:16:18,380 --> 00:16:20,900
(Dongting Lake Station. Passengers
getting off, please get ready.)

404
00:16:50,380 --> 00:16:55,260
♪I hide my racing heart without a sound♪

405
00:16:57,270 --> 00:17:02,070
♪I close my eyes and pretend
the story's been reset♪

406
00:17:03,400 --> 00:17:06,420
♪I steer clear of every path
that leads to you♪

407
00:17:06,420 --> 00:17:09,410
♪Trying to outrun the storm
we're destined for♪

408
00:17:09,930 --> 00:17:12,130
♪I thought if I didn't hear, see,
or speak of you♪

409
00:17:12,130 --> 00:17:15,580
♪I could cut every thread
that ties us together♪

410
00:17:16,810 --> 00:17:21,830
♪Through the endless night,
I guard my only secret♪

411
00:17:23,410 --> 00:17:28,430
♪In this new cycle, I watch you
become innocent again♪

412
00:17:29,590 --> 00:17:31,720
♪I tried to erase the fire we once had♪

413
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:35,470
♪But I can't erase your name
carved into my bones♪

414
00:17:36,230 --> 00:17:38,410
♪The more I try to leave you behind♪

415
00:17:38,410 --> 00:17:42,670
♪The deeper I sink with no end in sight♪

416
00:17:42,670 --> 00:17:45,590
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

417
00:17:45,590 --> 00:17:48,870
♪Could I finally break free
from this cycle♪

418
00:17:49,340 --> 00:17:51,220
♪What if I took things a little slower♪

419
00:17:51,220 --> 00:17:55,450
♪Could I delay the moment
everything falls apart♪

420
00:17:55,450 --> 00:17:59,250
♪Maybe if I retreat to the edge
of my dreams♪

421
00:17:59,250 --> 00:18:02,260
♪I could give you another future♪

422
00:18:02,580 --> 00:18:08,810
♪A tomorrow where I no longer exist♪

423
00:18:08,810 --> 00:18:11,080
♪Even if I never want to see you again♪

424
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:12,720
♪This nightmare still won't end♪

425
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:14,580
♪Even if it all plays out again♪

426
00:18:14,580 --> 00:18:16,770
♪I'll still find my way back to you♪

427
00:18:16,770 --> 00:18:20,670
♪Even if having you only leaves me
in your debt♪

428
00:18:20,670 --> 00:18:24,660
♪It's still better than
losing you forever♪
